<title>UK: BZW sets warrants on Rolls Royce.</title>
<headline>BZW sets warrants on Rolls Royce.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>BZW Warrants has issued 50</p>
<p>million</p>
<p>European-style call warrants, on Rolls Royce shares, lead</p>
<p>manager BZW Securities said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.65 STG		  ISSUE PRICE  0.75 STG</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 27.JUN.98		 PAYDATE	18.JUL.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LUXEMBOURG		MIN EXER LOT =</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  2.40 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
